# Kalastria Highborn: "Whenever this creature or another Vampire you control dies, ..." (CR 603.10a, 700.4): "this creature" is not
# "this Vampire", so Kalastria Highborn triggers on its own death whatever its creature types were as it last was on the battlefield.
# Bot2's Nameless Inversion gives it +3/-3 and takes all its creature types, keeping its abilities: it dies a 5/-1 with no
# creature type and still triggers. Bot1 targets Bot2 and pays {B} with Mox Jet: Bot2 loses 2 (18) and Bot1 gains 2 (22).

